[I] Safely and cleanly create closures via string eval

[T] Eval::Closure creates closures from strings of code via eval, with
[T] explicitly passed captured variables and a clean lexical scope, and
[T] reports errors with useful context.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/Eval-Closure

